## 5. Security Decisions (locked)

- **Password rule:** min 8 chars, at least 1 uppercase, 1 number. Checked client-side (UX) and server-side (source of truth) with Zod.
- **Bcrypt cost factor:** 12.
- **Rate limits:** login 5/15min per IP+email, register 5/hour per IP, forgot-password 3/hour per IP, resend-verification 1/60s per email.
- **Generic error messages** on login/register/forgot-password to prevent user enumeration.
- **CORS:** whitelist only your frontend origin(s), `credentials: true` for cookies.
- **Helmet** enabled globally for security headers.
- **Input validation:** every route validated with a Zod schema before touching the DB.
- **Refresh token rotation:** every refresh call issues a new refresh token and revokes the old one.
- **Force logout on password reset:** all refresh tokens revoked when password changes.

