## 6. Roles & Permissions (RBAC)

Three roles, permission checks done server-side via middleware — never trust the frontend to hide a button as your only protection.

| Role | Can do |
|---|---|
| `user` | Manage own profile, own conversations, view own badges/XP |
| `moderator` | Everything `user` can, + view all users, ban/unban users |
| `admin` | Everything `moderator` can, + assign roles, view audit logs |

Middleware pattern: `requireRole(['admin'])` on protected routes, checks `req.user.role` (decoded from JWT) against an allow-list.

