## 7. XP & Leveling System

**Formula (application-computed, not stored as a trigger):**
```
xp_required_for_level(n) = round(100 * n^1.5)
```
Level 1→2: 100 XP · Level 2→3: 283 XP · Level 3→4: 520 XP · Level 4→5: 800 XP, etc.

On every `xp_transactions` insert: increment `users.xp`, recompute `users.level` by walking the formula, and check badge criteria (see below).

**XP awarding table:**

| Action | XP | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Register | 5 | On successful signup |
| Verify email | 10 | On successful verification |
| Complete profile (avatar + bio) | 20 | One-time |
| Daily login | 5 | Max once per calendar day |
| Send a message to the AI | 2 | Capped at 20/day to prevent grinding |

