## 8. Badges System

Criteria types map directly to `badges.criteria_type`:

| Badge | Criteria type | Value | Trigger point |
|---|---|---|---|
| Welcome Aboard | manual | — | Awarded at registration |
| Verified | manual | — | Awarded on email verification |
| Getting Started | xp_threshold | 100 | Checked after every XP transaction |
| Power User | xp_threshold | 1000 | Checked after every XP transaction |
| Century Club | action_count | 100 messages | Checked when message count hits threshold |

Implementation: a single `checkAndAwardBadges(userId)` function runs after any XP-changing event, queries `badges` for unmet criteria, and inserts into `user_badges` if met (guarded by the `UNIQUE(user_id, badge_id)` constraint so it's safe to call repeatedly).

