## 10. Implementation Order

1. DB schema + migrations (Prisma) — `users`, `roles` first
2. Register + login + JWT/refresh middleware (core loop working end to end)
3. Email verification (wire Resend)
4. Forgot/reset password
5. User management endpoints + admin routes + RBAC middleware
6. XP transactions + leveling logic
7. Badges + `checkAndAwardBadges`
8. Memory tables (`conversations`/`messages`) — wire once the AI chat endpoint exists
9. Rate limiting + Helmet + CORS lockdown (do this before demo day, not after)

---

*OTP and OAuth are deliberately excluded from this spec. When you're ready to add them, OAuth slots in as an alternate `POST /api/auth/oauth/:provider` flow that creates/links a `users` row without a `password_hash`; OTP would add a `phone_number` column and an `otp_codes` table following the same hashed-token pattern used above.*
